  "description": "\"We're getting divorced.\"\n\nExhausted from a loveless marriage, she brought up divorce. Hoping he would hold onto her, her husband turned away without a hint of hesitation, proving her futile hope.\n\nFive years after becoming strangers, she encounters her ex-husband in the matchmaking spot where he was driven away from home. A impulsive night, driven by unresolved emotions, shakes up their once-settled routine.\n\n\"Just because it's yours doesn't mean you can use and discard it as you please.\"\n\nLike a fierce predator relentlessly chasing its prey, she wanted to avoid him, but she couldn't.\n\n\"Marry me again.\"\n\nWas grabbing the hand of a man aiming for an image makeover the problem?\n\n\"We will inevitably meet an unhappy end.\"\n\nEven if it's just a physical connection and there are no feelings involved,\n\n\"That unhappy end. I want to see it for myself.\"\n\nDespite knowing how dangerous and reckless it is,\n\nWe remarried.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/63015943), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%9E%AC%ED%98%BC-%EB%B6%80%EB%B6%80/3815)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/161857)",
